minios-module-manager (1.0.7) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Accept the phase record schema emitted by savechanges
  * Classify savechanges cancellation from its phase and exit status, rejecting
    contradictory terminal records
  * Reject non-object JSON records from all streaming backends
  * Use fixed trusted capture executables and validate the published module,
    result schema, phase sequence, identity, and digest before reporting success

 -- crims0n <crims0n@minios.dev>  Fri, 04 Sep 2026 14:45:11 +0300

